cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying dataset, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "RIS-ISAC-DRL: real-time deep reinforcement learning control of RIS-assisted ISAC under partial observations"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and training code for a proximal-policy-optimisation controller
  that sets the phases of a reconfigurable intelligent surface, the
  communication-sensing power split and the user weights every 100 ms in a
  monostatic ISAC system whose target is outside the base station's line of
  sight. Channels come from a ray-traced digital twin built with NVIDIA
  Sionna RT.
